{
  "_comment": [
    "Who may edit what. Human-controlled: only the user changes this file (the orchestrator only when the user asks).",
    "Read by the bakery-team plugin's ownership hook (PreToolUse, Edit|Write|NotebookEdit) and tools/ownership/check.py (mise run ownership-check).",
    "Format: orchestrator = main session (no agent_type); agents = keyed by agent_type; each has the git name/email it commits with and 'paths'.",
    "Globs on repo-relative paths: ** = any depth (also none), * = within one segment, leading ! excludes a path an earlier glob allowed (last match wins).",
    "human_controlled wins over every list: agents are denied, the orchestrator gets 'ask'. A path may have several owners. Full rules: docstring of tools/ownership/ownership_lib.py (same file as the plugin's hooks/ownership_lib.py).",
    "Each agent also owns its own persistent memory folder .claude/agent-memory/bakery-team-<agent>/ (plugin agents run as bakery-team:<agent>; memory: project)."
  ],
  "orchestrator": {
    "name": "Rickroll Rick",
    "email": "rick@bakery.invalid",
    "paths": [
      "CLAUDE.md",
      "docs/briefs/**",
      ".github/**"
    ]
  },
  "agents": {
